  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.2: SIMD optimizations across the board. HighwayHash64: AVX2/SSE4.1 optimization (1.4x faster). Whirlpool: Custom T-table implementation (3.2x faster). Grøstl: AES-NI SubBytes + T-table MixBytes (~2.5x faster). JH: Bit-sliced S-box + SSSE3 (~1.4x faster). GitHub Actions CI/CD added. Memory allocations greatly reduced. All optimizations have scalar fallbacks. 752 tests passing. All 71 algorithms validated.",
